    "abstract": "AES3 provides for the serial digital transmission of two channels of periodically sampled and uniformly quantized audio signals on various media.\nThis Part specifies the framing and channel coding for transmission on a unidirectional point-to-point physical link. The specified format minimizes the direct-current (DC) component on the transmission line, facilitates clock recovery from the data stream, and makes the interface insensitive to the polarity of connections.",
